{"slug":"Universal-Script-Shadow-Universal-Hub-135139","_id":"69b9ac83ec95ce09d136ce26","title":"Shadow Universal Hub","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"🔥 Shadow Hub v2.8.1 — Universal Edition 🔥\n\nNot a very comprehensive hub, but it'll do the trick. Here's the\nfeatures and the boring part. Just to show script on top but idk if that have an effect. I will update hub monthly or i dont know maybe i'll forget. \n\n▶ Press INSERT to toggle menu\n\n✅ Features:\n• 👻 Server-Side Invisibility \n• 🛡 God Mode ON/OFF \n• 👁 Player ESP (Name + Distance + Health Color)\n• ✈ Fly (WASD + Space/Shift)\n• 👻 Noclip (walk through walls)\n• 🦘 Infinite Jump\n• 🏃 WalkSpeed Changer (16-500)\n• ⬆ JumpPower Changer (50-500)\n• 📍 Teleport to nearest player\n• 🖱 Click Teleport\n• 📌 Coordinate Teleport (Spawn / Sky / Center)\n• ⚔ Hitbox Expander (adjustable size)\n• 🌀 Spin Bot (adjustable speed)\n• 🤖 Auto Jump\n• 🔧 Anti AFK\n• 📊 FPS Counter (color coded)\n• 🌈 Rainbow Border\n• 🔀 Server Hop\n• 🔁 Rejoin\n• 📋 Copy Game ID / Server ID\n• 👥 Auto-updating player list with TP buttons\n• ❄ Freeze/Unfreeze character\n• 🌍 Gravity changer\n\n🎮 Game: Universal (works in any game)\n📌 Key: INSERT to open/close\n🖥 UI: Draggable, minimizable, animated\n\n⚠ Recommended Executors: Xeno, Fluxus, Wave, Hydrogen, Solara\n\n💡 Tips:\n• Use Ghost Mode button for Invisible + Noclip + Fly combo\n• God Mode uses real IY method (replaces Humanoid)\n• To disable God Mode, press the disable button (will respawn)\n• ESP works on all players with health-based color coding\n• Invisibility: You appear semi-transparent to yourself,\n  completely invisible to others\n\n⚡ Loadstring:\nJust copy and paste the code into your executor.","tags":["universal","hub","god mode","invisible","fly"],"script":"loadstring(gam